  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Lang Ya blessed land, mortal killer moves cannot be used, so Xue Song Zi waves his sleeve and casts cold condensed snow. The blizzard howls. Egg sized lumps of snow fly at a yellow jade lion. Frost energy spreads and lays a thick layer of frost on its body.",
      "chapters": [
        874
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_xue_song_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The move’s attacking power is not enough to drop the lion. The frost is meant to invade the body and cut speed and movement. The lion shakes most of the frost off. Its species’ thick fur keeps the frost from freezing flesh and blood the way it would on another desolate beast.",
